  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spells stretch beyond the limits of their normal firepower.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Intensified Spell<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a spell augmented with Intensified Spell, its maximum number of damage dice is increased by 10 levels. You must actually have sufficient caster levels to surpass the maximum in order to benefit from this feat. No other variables of the spell are affected, and spells that inflict damage that is not modified by caster level are not affected by this feat.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to cast a spell as an Intensified spell (gaining only the normal benefits of an intensified spell, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without preparing it as Intensified in advance, taking extra casting time, or increasing the level of spell slot it uses.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> An intensified spell has its maximum number of damage dice increased by 5 levels.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
